Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1789905599999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bar 90's 2771 high with a close 255.7 lower is a buy-climax bar, and the 29 bars since then overlap inside the range rather than trending - trading-range behavior after a climax.", "No close has exceeded 2771; the recent highs 2680 (bar 111) and 2700 (bar 119) are below the spike high, so the range top has already rejected the bulls.", "Bar 115 fell from 2517.53 to 2358.62 in a single bar, showing fast two-sided movement inside the range and poor trend persistence.", "The final bar closed 67.02 below its own 2700 high, so there is no acceptance yet at the upper boundary; the bull push is an in-range leg, not a confirmed breakout.", "The 2357.18 and 2358.62 lows are roughly equal, which marks a range floor that has been tested twice and can break rather than hold."], "evidence_for": ["Net window change is upward (open 2066.43 to close 2632.98) and the post-crash lows rose: 1368.42 (bar 14), 1512.91 (bar 34), 1803.74 (bar 55), 1821.49 (bar 72), 2357.18 (bar 102).", "Bar 88 broke out of a roughly 27-bar consolidation with a 377.29-point range (1905.63-2293.8) closing at 2252.16, and bars 89-90 followed through to 2771, satisfying the breakout-plus-follow-through test.", "Price holds well above the breakout: the last close 2632.98 is about 38% above bar 88's 1905.63 low and has not returned to bar 89's 2111 low.", "The most recent leg is bull: four consecutive higher closes off the 2358.62 double-bottom retest, and bar 119's 2632.98 is the highest close in the supplied window.", "The post-spike range has held above the spike bar's 2325.31 low and keeps making higher swing lows inside the range (2357.18 then 2358.62 with a higher close)."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, with the decision at the close of the final bar (close_time 1789862399999).", "Window high is 2771 (bar 90, open_time 1787270400000); window low is 1368.42 (bar 14, open_time 1780704000000).", "Bars 10-14 (1780358400000-1780704000000) are five overlapping bear bars driving 2006.17 down to 1368.42; bar 14 closes 1568.55, about 200 points above its low, a sell-climax tail.", "Bar 88 (1787097600000) opens 1916.51 inside the prior consolidation and closes 2252.16 near its 2293.8 high; bars 89-90 close 2326.32 and 2515.3, and bar 90 prints 2771 and closes 255.7 below that high.", "Bars 91-119 overlap between 2357.18 (bar 102 low, 1788307200000) and 2700 (bar 119 high); bar 90's low of 2325.31 was never revisited.", "Roughly equal lows at 2357.18 (bar 102) and 2358.62 (bar 115, 1789430400000) form a double bottom at the range low, followed by four higher closes (2416.57, 2446.22, 2612.02, 2632.98).", "The final bar's close 2632.98 is the highest close in the whole window, while its high 2700 stays 71 below bar 90's 2771 high; the last bar closes 67.02 under its own high."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear leg into a sell climax: bars 0-14 decline from bar 0's 2143.61 high to bar 14's 1368.42 low; the final bars are large bear trend bars and bar 14 closes 200.13 above its low.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779494400000, "upper_boundary": "2143.61"}, {"description": "Two-sided consolidation (bars 61-87, about 27 bars): upper boundary is bar 65's 1974.46 high with repeated 1919-1938 highs; lower boundary is the triple equal low 1821.69/1821.59/1821.49 (bars 70-72). Bar 88 later opened at 1916.51 inside it before breaking out.", "end_time_ms": 1787183999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1821.49", "start_time_ms": 1784764800000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike (bars 88-90): 1916.51 to 2252.16 to 2326.32 to a 2515.3 close, with bar 90 reaching 2771 and closing 255.7 off the high - a buy-climax bar.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-climax trading range (bars 91-119): upper boundary 2771.00 with internal highs capped at 2557.46, 2537.57, 2680 and 2700; lower boundary 2357.18 (bar 102 low), retested at 2358.62 (bar 115).", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Recent bull leg: four consecutive bull closes from bar 115's 2358.62 low to bar 119's 2700 high; bar 119's close 2632.98 is the highest close of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2771 followed by a bar holding above 2771 would confirm a bull breakout and move the read toward breakout-spike/channel.", "Rejection at 2700-2771 with a bear close back below 2604.75 keeps the range classification and supports rotation back toward the 2400 area.", "A close below 2357.18 would break the range's double bottom and shift the read toward a range breakdown or deeper bear leg.", "A close below 2111 (bar 89 low) or 1905.63 (bar 88 low) would negate the bull breakout structure and make the bear side the structural read.", "Continued overlapping bars closing between roughly 2400 and 2700 would keep phase as range and Always-In relevance low."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789891199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Strongest counter: the breakout is being handed back - the last two closes (2586.68 and 2576.9) are below the 2609.02 level that had held for seven bars and below the 2604.75 flag low, so the excursion above the prior range is currently a failed breakout back inside the 2464.45-2609.02 range.", "The 2700 high (bar 1789804800000) was rejected intraday on a 77.33-point bar closing 15.82 above its low, a bearish tail at a round number, and it came only 20 bars after the 2680 spike (bar 1789128000000) that also closed 124.48 below its high (2555.52).", "Roughly 60 or more of the 120 supplied bars sit inside the overlapping 2411.04-2537.57 and 2464.45-2609.02 ranges and price now sits mid-range, so the dominant window structure is two-sided and the bull leg can still be read as a leg inside a range rather than the regime."], "evidence_for": ["Higher low plus higher high on the window's major swings: 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000) sits above the earlier 2357.18 (bar 1788336000000), and 2700 (bar 1789804800000) exceeds the earlier window high 2680 (bar 1789128000000) and the 2609.02 range top, so the latest leg broke to new window highs.", "Trend-bar quality with follow-through: bars 1789732800000 and 1789747200000 closed near their highs with minimal overlap, and the next seven closes (2612.02 to 2640.01) all held above the 2609.02 breakout level, which is acceptance rather than a one-bar poke.", "The pullback is small relative to the leg: from 2700 the market retraced only to 2569.8/2570 (~38% of the 2358.62-to-2700 leg) and remains above the 2537.57 prior swing high and far above the 2495.82 low of spike bar 1789732800000, so the leg's higher-low structure is intact."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window ends at 2576.9 (bar open 1789876800000); extremes are 2357.18 (low of bar 1788336000000) and 2700 (high of bar 1789804800000), so price closes in the upper-middle of a wide ~343-point 20-day range.", "Large double bottom: 2357.18 (bar 1788336000000, close 2379.67) retested at 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000, close 2412.95); the second low is marginally higher.", "Last leg: 22 bars from 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000) to 2700 (bar 1789804800000, ~14.5%). Spike bars 1789732800000 (open 2507.15, high 2585.5, close 2578.6) and 1789747200000 (open 2579.97, high 2643.52, close 2636.28) closed near their highs with little overlap.", "Seven consecutive closes above the prior range top 2609.02 (high of bar 1789416000000): 2612.02, 2619.15, 2626.53, 2638.49, 2640.01, 2633.54, 2632.98 (bars 1789761600000 through 1789848000000).", "The leg stalled in a tight 7-bar overlap between 2604.75 (low of bar 1789776000000) and 2658.79 (high of bar 1789833600000); bar 1789804800000 poked the round number 2700 but closed 2638.49, in the lower ~20% of its 2622.67-2700 range.", "Last two bars are bear bars: 1789862400000 (2632.98 to 2586.68, low 2569.8) and 1789876800000 (2586.68 to 2576.9, low 2570); both close below the 2604.75 flag low and below the 2609.02 prior range top.", "Mid-window: bars 1788508800000-1789113600000 traded 2411.04-2537.57; bar 1789128000000 spiked to 2680 but closed 2555.52 (large upper tail), and the following 20 bars held roughly 2464.45-2609.02 before the six-bar bear leg to 2358.62."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Mid-window trading range after the 2537.57 spike high, roughly 40 bars of overlapping two-sided trade between 2411.04 and 2537.57.", "end_time_ms": 1789113600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788508800000, "upper_boundary": "2537.57"}, {"description": "Post-spike consolidation following the 2680 single-bar spike (bar 1789128000000): ~20 bars contained between 2464.45 and 2609.02.", "end_time_ms": 1789416000000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2464.45", "start_time_ms": 1789142400000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Six-bar bear leg out of that range: 2609.02 (high of bar 1789416000000) down to 2358.62 (low of bar 1789488000000), with large bear bars closing near their lows.", "end_time_ms": 1789488000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Spike-and-channel bull leg from the 2358.62 double-bottom higher low to the window high 2700, breaking above the 2537.57 and 2609.02 prior range tops with two large trend bars and seven closes holding above 2609.02.", "end_time_ms": 1789804800000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Tight 7-bar flag at the top of the bull leg (2604.75-2658.79) including a rejected intraday poke to 2700 (bar 1789804800000, close 2638.49); the last two bars (1789862400000, 1789876800000) broke the flag low and closed back below 2609.02.", "end_time_ms": 1789876800000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2604.75", "start_time_ms": 1789761600000, "upper_boundary": "2658.79"}, {"description": "Reversal candidate, not confirmed: bull leg into a marginal new window high 2700 at a round number with a bearish close (2638.49) and a lower high since, followed by two bear bars breaking the 7-bar flag and the 2609.02 breakout level. No confirmed break of the leg's higher low yet.", "end_time_ms": 1789876800000, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789804800000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull resumption: a bar closing above 2658.79 (high of bar 1789833600000) and then acceptance above 2700 would mark the two-bar drop as a bull-flag pullback inside the channel.", "Failed-breakout/trading-range shift: continued closes below 2609.02 with a lower high under 2700, especially a close below 2537.57, would put the market back inside the mid-window range and shift the read toward trading-range/range phase.", "Bull-leg end: a close below 2495.82 (low of bar 1789732800000) with follow-through would break the leg's last higher low and expose 2464.45 (low of bar 1789300800000) and the mid-window range.", "Two-sided continuation: further overlapping bars between roughly 2500 and 2660 with no new high above 2700 and no break of 2495.82 would move the phase from channel to range (final-flag/trading-range behavior).", "Reversal evidence: a lower high below 2700 followed by a break of 2569.8/2570 (lows of the last two bars) with follow-through would turn the 2700 poke into a failed-breakout top within the range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2477.97", "close_time_ms": 1789477199999, "high": "2484.35", "low": "2473.97", "open": "2475.02", "open_time_ms": 1789473600000, "volume": "1973847.893"}, {"close": "2447.69", "close_time_ms": 1789480799999, "high": "2484.01", "low": "2440.37", "open": "2477.54", "open_time_ms": 1789477200000, "volume": "2327281.37"}, {"close": "2412.24", "close_time_ms": 1789484399999, "high": "2454.38", "low": "2390.73", "open": "2447.69", "open_time_ms": 1789480800000, "volume": "2722631.95"}, {"close": "2423.29", "close_time_ms": 1789487999999, "high": "2431.78", "low": "2402.03", "open": "2414.41", "open_time_ms": 1789484400000, "volume": "2240738.512"}, {"close": "2421.99", "close_time_ms": 1789491599999, "high": "2424.28", "low": "2415.14", "open": "2423.22", "open_time_ms": 1789488000000, "volume": "2248462.627"}, {"close": "2440.27", "close_time_ms": 1789495199999, "high": "2442.15", "low": "2412.47", "open": "2422.25", "open_time_ms": 1789491600000, "volume": "2279307.963"}, {"close": "2401.73", "close_time_ms": 1789498799999, "high": "2441", "low": "2358.62", "open": "2440.65", "open_time_ms": 1789495200000, "volume": "3189011.213"}, {"close": "2412.95", "close_time_ms": 1789502399999, "high": "2434.74", "low": "2399.66", "open": "2402.94", "open_time_ms": 1789498800000, "volume": "2490318.621"}, {"close": "2407", "close_time_ms": 1789505999999